This package contains original project code and selected frozen research results.
The underlying FACHB905 metabolic network and its reconstruction and LP-response
generation workflow are not distributed here. The precomputed response tables
are the input interface to the downstream lake model.

Third-party observations and hydrodynamic data retain their original providers'
rights and attribution requirements. FVCOM source code, third-party database
exports, software dependencies, and personal download correspondence are not
bundled. See docs/data_provenance.md for the included assets and their roles.

